scenario: booting fixture
@etude 1 begin machine.shutdown.poweroff
@etude 1 assert stopped pass
@etude 1 assert poweroff-status pass
@etude 1 assert clean-unmount pass
@etude 1 assert no-halt-fallback pass
@etude 1 assert said-poweroff pass
@etude 1 assert not-restart pass
@etude 1 progress stage 1
@etude 1 progress fsck 0
@etude 1 assert fsck-clean pass
@etude 1 progress fsck 1
@etude 1 progress stage 2
@etude 1 assert marker-survives pass
@etude 1 progress stage 3
@etude 1 end 8
